{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "John: Hey Maria, how's it going? Been real busy tackling a project to support military veterans. Trying to get a petition going, it's pretty rewarding but kinda stressful. How are you?"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-41/session_15-2fd4fd2eb37fec173e3e4128", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T14:13:46.501215+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "2fd4fd2eb37fec173e3e4128", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "2fd4fd2eb37fec173e3e4128", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Maria: Hey John, I'm good. Sorry to hear it's been rough. How did you decide to take on that project?"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-41/session_15-9dc69e91a4f821d0531ffa09", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T14:13:46.542692+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "9dc69e91a4f821d0531ffa09", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "9dc69e91a4f821d0531ffa09", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "John: Hi Maria, thanks for asking. I've always been passionate about veterans and their rights. Last week, I realized again how much they've done for us and wanted to show my appreciation in some way. So, I worked on a project to support them. It's my way of giving back."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-41/session_15-c7b525706981ba1d9454fa8f", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T14:13:46.558803+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "c7b525706981ba1d9454fa8f", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "c7b525706981ba1d9454fa8f", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Maria: Wow, John! What a kind gesture. It's really cool seeing you making a difference."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-41/session_15-2a90121b5398cbf3e5e97d53", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T14:13:46.579112+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "2a90121b5398cbf3e5e97d53", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "2a90121b5398cbf3e5e97d53", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "John: Thanks, Maria. It sure has taken a lot of work, but I think it's worth it. Just want to let them know their hard work is appreciated."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-41/session_15-9a355fe4f6e3d47e26aa642e", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T14:13:46.597252+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "9a355fe4f6e3d47e26aa642e", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "9a355fe4f6e3d47e26aa642e", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Maria: Wow, John, that's awesome! Your project is going to be great for them!"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-41/session_15-f03265b293cdcd2942d05bf3", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T14:13:46.618870+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "f03265b293cdcd2942d05bf3", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "f03265b293cdcd2942d05bf3", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "John: Yeah, I hope so. They've given so much and deserve our backing. I want to help make their lives better."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-41/session_15-a6bbcec2ecb98e61112a87e4", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T14:13:46.636022+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "a6bbcec2ecb98e61112a87e4", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "a6bbcec2ecb98e61112a87e4", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Maria: That's great, John! It's awesome that you're doing that."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-41/session_15-816da9113f3ed35d06a4591c", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T14:13:46.659076+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "816da9113f3ed35d06a4591c", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "816da9113f3ed35d06a4591c", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "John: I'm really passionate about making sure veterans are supported and valued in our community, so let's make it happen!"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-41/session_15-b5b3d7464c7eeb60ddea9ae1", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T14:13:46.681508+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "b5b3d7464c7eeb60ddea9ae1", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "b5b3d7464c7eeb60ddea9ae1", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Maria: Count me in, John! I'm in to help out with that. Let's make a difference together."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-41/session_15-d63b5ab6865f9b0e9912caf6", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T14:13:46.698136+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "d63b5ab6865f9b0e9912caf6", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "d63b5ab6865f9b0e9912caf6", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "John: Awesome, Maria! I knew you'd be on board. With your help, we can make a real impact. Thank you so much! Here's a pic from last Friday with some veterans who are really excited about this. Their support keeps me motivated."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-41/session_15-b350cd56d31b25391db28cda", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T14:13:46.719396+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "b350cd56d31b25391db28cda", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "b350cd56d31b25391db28cda", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Maria: Wow, John, that looks great! What did you do to make them so happy?"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-41/session_15-397a0ab321cba7c518ee209f", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T14:13:46.747702+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "397a0ab321cba7c518ee209f", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "397a0ab321cba7c518ee209f", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "John: Thanks, Maria! We had a great time throwing a small party and inviting some veterans to share their stories. It was awesome seeing them make connections and find camaraderie. All the smiles and new friendships made it really heartwarming."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-41/session_15-e310a7848c7f594c5450b8b1", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T14:13:46.769647+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "e310a7848c7f594c5450b8b1", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "e310a7848c7f594c5450b8b1", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Maria: Wow, John, that's really heartwarming! Stories and connections can truly make a difference."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-41/session_15-4f09b4e8d3bc85f5eee1202e", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T14:13:46.794131+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "4f09b4e8d3bc85f5eee1202e", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "4f09b4e8d3bc85f5eee1202e", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "John: Yeah, Maria. It reminded me of that sense of community and togetherness. It made me realize how important it is to help veterans."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-41/session_15-9890ee61c39fc322f1aa80fb", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T14:13:46.817376+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "9890ee61c39fc322f1aa80fb", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "9890ee61c39fc322f1aa80fb", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Maria: Yeah John! It's great to see how your project is making a difference for them. The sense of community and support really matters. Keep doing what you're doing; I'm here to back you up!"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-41/session_15-15a7d68e996394b5a5c3f3ab", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T14:13:46.839556+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "15a7d68e996394b5a5c3f3ab", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "15a7d68e996394b5a5c3f3ab", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "John: Thanks, Maria! Your support means a lot. Together, we can make a difference for our veterans!"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-41/session_15-e11efacf1b6ba8ab5a57a1e1", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T14:13:46.869880+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "e11efacf1b6ba8ab5a57a1e1", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "e11efacf1b6ba8ab5a57a1e1", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Maria: Yep, John! Keep going and we'll make a difference! I'm currently planning a ring-toss tournament for the homeless shelter's fundraiser later this month, I can't wait to see the impact it will make."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-41/session_15-58146cb93fe98de129d8eb78", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T14:13:46.891670+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "58146cb93fe98de129d8eb78", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "58146cb93fe98de129d8eb78", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "John: Wow, sounds fun! I can't wait to hear more about it. Talk to you soon!"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-41/session_15-e7e0dcc203110c900d5de243", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T14:13:46.908957+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "e7e0dcc203110c900d5de243", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "e7e0dcc203110c900d5de243", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
